"description":"- Solflare is the most powerful self-custodial crypto wallet on Solana, managing $15B+ in crypto assets and trusted by 4M+ active users.\n- All-in-one wallet to store, stake, swap crypto, manage your portfolio, manage tokens, and NFTs. Easily access and explore your favorite Web3 dApps and NFT communities.\n- Securely explore, trade, and manage over 3M+ tokens and meme coins. You control your crypto.\n- Beginners and pros can look to build wealth through DeFi, staking, and trading crypto on Solana.\n\nSolflare is your go-to wallet for crypto, DeFi, and Web3. Install Solflare today and claim your place in the Stronghold of the Free!\n\n• Self-custody wallet\nTake control of your crypto. Solflare provides a secure self-custody wallet with advanced protection and the freedom to explore Solana on your terms. For even stronger protection, pair your Solflare wallet with a hardware wallet such as Solflare Shield, Ledger, or Keystone.\n\n• Move coins more easily than money\nQuickly send crypto to any Solana address or scan a QR code for instant token transfers. Share your QR code/wallet address to receive funds. Also, send any token and pay gas fees with stablecoins. You can also use Private Send to hide the sending wallet from the recipient.\n\n• Stake SOL\nMake your crypto work for you. Stake to earn passive income from your SOL while increasing Solana's stability. You can unstake at any time to access your tokens.\n\n• Trade victoriously\nSwap tokens for success. Identify the most promising meme coins from 3M+ Solana coins. As soon as new tokens are created, swap them at the best rates, lightning fast.\n\n• Manage your collectibles\nStore, view, and manage your collectibles on the Solana blockchain. \n\n• Trends, tools, and market visibility\nStay on top of the Web3 and DeFi world with custom watchlists, real-time data, and trends. Track performance with Profit and Loss, review token balance history, and utilize Risk Overview when assessing swaps. Plus, utilize candlestick token charts and buy/sell indicators.\n\n• Track everything in your portfolio\nSee your coins, collectibles, staking activity, and DeFi positions in one place. Personalize your view and monitor performance from a single screen.\n\n• Limit Orders\nTrigger crypto swaps and staking trades in advance.\n\n• Connect to your favorite Solana Web3 dApps\nAccess Solana Web3 dApps directly from the wallet, including Jupiter, Raydium, Pump.fun, DEX Screener, and Magic Eden.\n\n• Get hardware wallet support with Solflare Shield\nManage your tokens, NFTs, and crypto assets while keeping your holdings offline and extra safe with Solflare’s affordable Solflare Shield cold storage.\n\n• Around-the-clock human support\nNeed help? Our support team is available around the clock through live chat to help with questions regarding your wallet, crypto, staking, collectibles, tokens, and swaps.", "sellerUrl":"https://solflare.com/", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN"], "fileSizeBytes":"227084288", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":9688, "trackContentRating":"17+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.841969999999999885176293901167809963226318359375, "minimumOsVersion":"16.0", "userRatingCount":9688}]
